	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element" >
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<p><strong>The Traffic Violation Bureau</strong>, a division of the General Sessions Court, is responsible for processing citations issued by various law enforcement agencies for violations of Metropolitan ordinances and Tennessee motor vehicle laws. Our office manages court date scheduling, citation record maintenance, and the collection of associated fines and fees.</p>
<p>To review the details of your citation and explore available resolution options, please visit the <a href="https://paytraffic.nashville.gov" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><strong>Ticket | Citation Portal</strong></a> and follow the on-screen instructions.</p>

